# finx

--- Chronomancer_gadget_1 | gadget | TID_CHRONOMANCER_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Finx steps back in time, returning to the position and ammo he had <VALUE1> seconds ago.
now  Finx steps back in time, returning to the position and ammo he had <VALUE1> seconds ago.
  VALUE1  -  -> 3

--- Chronomancer_gadget_2 | gadget | TID_CHRONOMANCER_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Finx's next projectiles from his main attack freeze the enemies in time for <VALUE1> seconds, making them unable to take actions for the duration, but also making them immune to any damage.
now  Finx's next projectiles from his main attack freeze the enemies in time for <VALUE1> seconds, making them unable to take actions for the duration, but also making them immune to any damage.
  VALUE1  -  -> 2

--- Chronomancer_unique_1 | star power | TID_CHRONOMANCER_SP_1_DESC
raw  Finx reduces the reload speed of any enemy Brawlers hit by his main attack by <!card.value1>% for <!card.value2.ticksasseconds> seconds.
now  Finx reduces the reload speed of any enemy Brawlers hit by his main attack by 25% for 3 seconds.
  card.value1  25  -> 25
  card.value2.ticksasseconds  3  -> 3

--- Chronomancer_unique_2 | star power | TID_CHRONOMANCER_SP_2_DESC
raw  Damage dealt only from Finx's projectiles that are sped up by Time Warp, will increase the Super duration by <VALUE1> seconds each.
now  Damage dealt only from Finx's projectiles that are sped up by Time Warp, will increase the Super duration by 5 seconds each.
  VALUE1  5  -> 0.25
